testdata/siglip-bench/
testdata/siglip-bench-l/

# repowise index — generated codebase-intelligence artifacts, never committed
.repowise/

# Task briefs / working prompts — drafts, not deliverables. Untracked here by
# choice: goinfer commits its docs/prompts (they are cited work orders), aikit
# treats them as scratch. Ignored rather than left untracked so they cannot make
# the release gates report a DIRTY tree and refuse a verdict.
docs/prompts/
